[en.FOCUS_C14_ENEMY_REPAY]
Repay Enemity with Justice

[en.FOCUS_C14_ENEMY_REPAY_desc]
“You don’t ask with respect. You don’t offer friendship. You don’t even think to call me ‘cousin’. Instead you come into my house on the family appreciation day and you ask me to do business. What have I ever done to make you treat me so disrespectfully?”

[zh.FOCUS_C14_ENEMY_REPAY]
以直报怨

[zh.FOCUS_C14_ENEMY_REPAY_desc]
“你对我一点尊重都没有。你不愿意和我交朋友。你甚至不愿称我为‘表哥’。反而在家族感恩日来到我家，让我做生意。我到底做了什么，让你如此不尊重我？”

